---
import Layout from '../../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Deck & Patio Builders - KBTony" lang="en">
	<main>
		<!-- Hero Section -->
		<section class="service-hero">
			<div class="container">
				<span class="category">Our Services</span>
				<h1>Custom Decks & Patios</h1>
				<p class="tagline">Expand your living space outdoors with a beautiful custom deck or patio.</p>
			</div>
		</section>

		<!-- Service Overview -->
		<section class="section">
			<div class="container content-grid">
				<div class="text-content">
					<h2>Outdoor Living Specialists</h2>
					<p>We design and build custom decks and patios that enhance your home's value and your lifestyle. From composite materials to natural wood, we create durable outdoor spaces for entertaining and relaxing.</p>
					
					<ul class="benefits-list">
						<li>Custom deck design and construction</li>
						<li>Composite (Trex) and natural wood options</li>
						<li>Patio pavers and stamped concrete</li>
						<li>Pergolas and shade structures</li>
						<li>Railings, stairs, and lighting</li>
					</ul>
				</div>
				<div class="image-content">
					<img src="/images/deck_hero.png" alt="Custom Deck and Patio" />
				</div>
			</div>
		</section>

		<!-- Materials Section -->
		<section class="section bg-surface">
			<div class="container">
				<div class="section-header text-center">
					<span class="subheading">Options</span>
					<h2>Decking Materials</h2>
					<div class="divider"></div>
					<p class="styles-intro">We help you choose the best material for durability, aesthetics, and maintenance.</p>
				</div>
				
				<div class="styles-grid">
					<div class="style-card">
						<div class="card-icon">🏗️</div>
						<h3>Composite (Trex)</h3>
						<p>Low maintenance, high durability, and resistant to fading, staining, and mold. Eco-friendly option.</p>
					</div>
					<div class="style-card">
						<div class="card-icon">🪵</div>
						<h3>Pressure Treated Wood</h3>
						<p>Classic look and affordable. Durable and strong, perfect for a traditional deck aesthetic.</p>
					</div>
					<div class="style-card">
						<div class="card-icon">🌲</div>
						<h3>Cedar & Redwood</h3>
						<p>Natural beauty with built-in resistance to rot and insects. Premium look and feel.</p>
					</div>
					<div class="style-card">
						<div class="card-icon">🧱</div>
						<h3>Stone & Pavers</h3>
						<p>For patios and ground-level spaces. Long-lasting, elegant, and virtually maintenance-free.</p>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</section>

		<!-- CTA Section -->
		<section class="section cta-section">
			<div class="container text-center">
				<h2>Dreaming of a New Deck?</h2>
				<p>Schedule a free design consultation and estimate today.</p>
				<a href="/en/contact" class="btn btn-primary btn-large">Get Free Estimate</a>
			</div>
		</section>
	</main>
</Layout>

<style>
	/* Same styles as other service pages */
	.service-hero {
		background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--color-primary) 0%, #001a3d 100%);
		color: white;
		padding: 6rem 0 4rem;
		text-align: center;
	}

	.category {
		color: var(--color-accent);
		text-transform: uppercase;
		font-size: 0.9rem;
		font-weight: 600;
		letter-spacing: 2px;
	}

	.service-hero h1 {
		font-size: 3.5rem;
		margin: 1rem 0;
	}

	.tagline {
		font-size: 1.3rem;
		max-width: 700px;
		margin: 0 auto;
		opacity: 0.95;
	}

	.content-grid {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
		gap: var(--spacing-lg);
		align-items: center;
	}

	.text-content h2 {
		color: var(--color-primary);
		margin-bottom: var(--spacing-md);
	}

	.benefits-list {
		list-style: none;
		padding: 0;
		margin-top: var(--spacing-md);
	}

	.benefits-list li {
		padding: 0.75rem 0;
		padding-left: 2rem;
		position: relative;
		line-height: 1.6;
	}

	.benefits-list li::before {
		content: '✓';
		position: absolute;
		left: 0;
		color: var(--color-accent);
		font-weight: 700;
		font-size: 1.2rem;
	}

	.image-content img {
		width: 100%;
		border-radius: 8px;
		box-shadow: var(--shadow-lg);
	}

	.cta-section {
		background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--color-primary) 0%, #001a3d 100%);
		color: white;
	}

	.cta-section h2 {
		color: white;
		margin-bottom: var(--spacing-sm);
	}

	.cta-section p {
		font-size: 1.2rem;
		margin-bottom: var(--spacing-md);
	}

	.btn-large {
		padding: 1.2rem 3rem;
		font-size: 1.1rem;
	}

	.bg-surface {
		background-color: var(--color-surface);
	}

	.subheading {
		display: block;
		color: var(--color-accent);
		font-weight: 600;
		text-transform: uppercase;
		letter-spacing: 2px;
		margin-bottom: var(--spacing-xs);
		font-size: 0.9rem;
	}

	.divider {
		width: 80px;
		height: 3px;
		background-color: var(--color-accent);
		margin: var(--spacing-sm) auto var(--spacing-md);
	}

	.text-center {
		text-align: center;
	}

	.styles-intro {
		max-width: 700px;
		margin: 0 auto var(--spacing-lg);
		font-size: 1.1rem;
		color: #666;
	}

	.styles-grid {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr));
		gap: var(--spacing-md);
		margin-top: var(--spacing-lg);
	}

	.style-card {
		background: white;
		border-radius: 8px;
		padding: var(--spacing-lg);
		box-shadow: var(--shadow-md);
		transition: transform 0.3s ease, box-shadow 0.3s ease;
		text-align: center;
	}

	.style-card:hover {
		transform: translateY(-5px);
		box-shadow: var(--shadow-lg);
	}

	.card-icon {
		font-size: 3rem;
		margin-bottom: var(--spacing-md);
	}

	.style-card h3 {
		color: var(--color-primary);
		margin-bottom: var(--spacing-sm);
		font-size: 1.2rem;
	}

	.style-card p {
		color: #666;
		line-height: 1.6;
	}

	@media (max-width: 768px) {
		.service-hero h1 {
			font-size: 2.5rem;
		}

		.content-grid {
			grid-template-columns: 1fr;
		}
	}
</style>
